Each sub-network (e.g., "Investment Banking") has a Summary Vector.\cb1 \
\ls11\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
