\f0\b0\fs32 \cf2 \cb5 That 20GB ballooning is a classic symptom of "Entity Explosion" and "Noise Ingestion." If you give the AI a raw conversation and say "Make a graph," it treats every "um," "maybe," or "yesterday" as a potential node.\cb1 \
\cb5 In your Rust-based system, you need to transition from Extraction to Deduction-Based Synthesis.\cb1 \
