\cf2 \cb5 2. How the Components Connect\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 The system functions as a State Machine managed by the 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 orchestrator.rs
\fs32 \cf2 \cb5 .\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Step A: The Research Phase\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa200\partightenfactor0
\ls31\ilvl0\cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Input: User Prompt.\cb1 \
\ls31\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Orchestrator: Calls 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 researcher.rs
\fs32 \cf2 \cb5 .\cb1 \
\ls31\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Researcher: Reads the 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 main_network.db
\fs32 \cf2 \cb5  to see which sub-graphs are relevant. It calls 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 search_tool.rs
\fs32 \cf2 \cb5  to pull nodes from Gold and Draft tiers.\cb1 \
\ls31\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Output: A "Context Packet" (JSON) containing facts and current conversation history.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Step B: The Action Phase\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa200\partightenfactor0
\ls32\ilvl0\cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Input: Context Packet + User Prompt.\cb1 \
\ls32\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Orchestrator: Calls 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 actor.rs
\fs32 \cf2 \cb5  (likely using Kimi 2.5 for high-quality prose).\cb1 \
\ls32\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Actor: Generates the response. Since it has "Read-only" access, it can't accidentally corrupt the graph.\cb1 \
\ls32\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Output: Response sent to User.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Step C: The Review Phase (Asynchronous)\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa200\partightenfactor0
\ls33\ilvl0\cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Input: The full exchange (Prompt + Response).\cb1 \
\ls33\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Orchestrator: Spawns a background thread (using 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 tokio::spawn
\fs32 \cf2 \cb5 ) for 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 reviewer.rs
\fs32 \cf2 \cb5 .\cb1 \
\ls33\ilvl0\cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reviewer: 1. Extracts deductions.\
\ls33\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
2. Uses 
\fs28 \cf4 \cb3 update_tool.rs
